253:         // Once a name has flushed, nothing reads `slot.name` again for the
254:         // life of the stream — skip the accumulation so a backend that
255:         // repeats the whole name on every delta doesn't grow an unread
256:         // `String` for no reason (SMA-547 §4). Captured from the same
257:         // `name_emitted` state the flush condition below re-derives, so it
258:         // cannot change which deltas flush.
