261:         let slot = self.pending.entry(key.clone()).or_default();
262:         // A name fragment identical to the name accumulated so far is treated
263:         // as a whole-name repeat and skipped, not appended -- otherwise a
264:         // backend that resends the complete function name on every delta
265:         // (instead of incrementally fragmenting it) would double it, e.g.
266:         // "search" + "search" -> "searchsearch". Pre-fix this case emitted
267:         // "search" correctly, so appending unconditionally here would be a
268:         // regression, not merely an unhandled edge.
269:         //
270:         // Known, accepted limitation: a tool genuinely named e.g. "aa" whose
271:         // name fragments as "a" + "a" cannot be told apart from a repeat
